    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Chamber of Commerce for Greater Philadelphia Members Optimistic About Business Conditions in 2022</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">14 Jan ’22</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">The survey, which was conducted in December 2021, polled 66 chamber members. </p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


